{'symbol': 'NLSN', 'date': '2022-04-14 18:02:00', 'title': 'NIELSEN DECLARES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': "NEW YORK , APRIL 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF NIELSEN HOLDINGS PLC (NYSE: NLSN) DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.06 PER SHARE OF NIELSEN'S COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON JUNE 16, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON JUNE 2, 2022."}